# Deploy to production after completed work

When a task (or a batch of related tasks) is finished and the app has meaningful user-facing or API changes:

1. Deploy to **Vercel production** with:
   `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes --scope aryanmandapatis-projects`
2. Confirm the deploy succeeded and report the live URL (typically `https://college-fit-wine.vercel.app`).
3. Do this at the **end** of the completed work — not mid-task, and not for pure Q&A / read-only exploration.
4. If deploy fails (auth/scope/build), fix or report the error; do not claim the site is live until prod succeeds.
5. Git commit/push only when the user asks; production deploy does not require a git commit.
